OL,3,GNEWSAMartial arts club owner jailed for
OL,4,Araping woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of a martial arts club has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for eight years after he
OL,8,Fraped a woman at his studio.
OL,10,FJuan Miguel Figueroa-Ball, 44, attacked
OL,11,Fthe woman during a one-to-one
OL,12,Fintroductory session at Ceres Brazilian
OL,13,FJiu-Jitsu in Richfield Avenue, Reading.
OL,15,FFigueroa-Ball, of Reading, was found
OL,16,Fguilty of one count of rape following a
OL,17,Ftrial at Reading Crown Court in August
OL,18,Fand he was jailed on 8 October.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
